1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:04,263
- Santa?
- Oh, hello, Sheldon.

2
00:00:05,639 --> 00:00:07,629
(Santa:)You should be asleep.

3
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:10,777
(Sheldon:)Well, then you shouldn't have jingle bells
on your boots.

4
00:00:12,212 --> 00:00:14,012
(Santa:)I've been wanting to talk to you.

5
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:18,414
(Santa:)I'm sorry I disappointed you
when you were a little boy.

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,650
(Santa:)I can do a lot of magical things...

7
00:00:22,822 --> 00:00:27,452
(Santa:)...but unfortunately bringing
your Pop-Pop back isn't one of them.

8
00:00:29,296 --> 00:00:33,786
- I understand.
- But I do have something special for you.

9
00:00:34,968 --> 00:00:36,368
(Santa:)Close your eyes.

10
00:00:38,538 --> 00:00:40,868
(Sheldon:)Oh, I hope it's a train.

11
00:00:41,041 --> 00:00:44,101
(Santa:)Oh, it's better than a train.

12
00:00:45,178 --> 00:00:47,308
(Sheldon:)Two trains?

13
00:00:48,014 --> 00:00:49,034
(Sheldon:)Better.

14
00:00:49,249 --> 00:00:54,979
- I'm getting three trains.
- Okay, open them.

15
00:00:59,359 --> 00:01:03,799
(Santa:)This is for leaving me in the dungeon
to be eaten alive by ogres.

16
00:01:03,964 --> 00:01:06,124
Now, hang on. In my defense...

17
00:01:06,299 --> 00:01:09,129
Ho, ho, ho, you big dork.

